    {
      "text": "Forest plot of Nipro PZA LPA sensitivity and specificity for pyrazinamide (PZA) resistance against phenotypic DST, with two studies: Mitarai (sensitivity 1.00 [0.40, 1.00], specificity 1.00) and Sekiguchi (sensitivity not estimable, specificity 1.00). Each row gives a study's TP, FP, FN and TN counts and sensitivity and specificity with 95% CI, plotted as squares with CI lines on 0–1 scales.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
